### Bug 3: DEFAULT RATE saat Jam 02:00 Tepat

**File:** [`transaction.service.ts`](file:///d:/Billiard_APPS/backend/src/transaction/transaction.service.ts#L1173-L1181)

**Root Cause:** Logika matching time slot (e.g., slot 17:00-02:00):
```ts
if (slot.endMin < slot.startMin) {  // wrap-around: endMin=120, startMin=1020 → true
  if (timeVal >= slot.startMin || timeVal < slot.endMin)  // BUG: < bukan <=
    matchedSlot = slot;
}
```
Jam 02:00 tepat: `timeVal=120`, kondisi `120 < 120` = **FALSE** → jatuh ke DEFAULT RATE.

**Fix:** Ganti `<` dengan `<=` pada kondisi wrap-around.

