### Fix 2: Audit Trail Grand Total Harus Dihitung Lokal

**File:** [`billiard.service.ts`](file:///d:/Billiard_APPS/backend/src/billiard/billiard.service.ts#L2279-L2315)

Daripada mengambil `freshTrans.grandTotal` dari DB (yang bisa salah karena race condition), hitung sendiri:

```ts
// SEBELUM (berpotensi race condition):
const freshTrans = await this.transactionService.getTransactionById(transaction.id);
const grand = Number(freshTrans.grandTotal || 0);

// SESUDAH (akurat, berdasarkan data lokal):
const cafeTot = Number(transaction?.cafeTotal || 0);
const sc = Number(transaction?.serviceChargeAmount || 0); 
const tax = Number(transaction?.vatAmount || 0);
// Grand total yang benar = billiard + cafe + sc + tax
const grand = billiardCost + cafeTot + sc + tax;
```

