### Fix 4: ThermalReceipt — Station Name Fallback

**File:** [`ThermalReceipt.tsx`](file:///d:/Billiard_APPS/frontend/src/components/ThermalReceipt.tsx#L394-L396)

```tsx
// SEBELUM:
{(tx.table?.tableName || tx.cafeTable?.tableName 
  || (tx.tableId ? `STATION-${tx.tableId}` : (tx.cafeTableId ? `CAFE-${tx.cafeTableId}` : 'W-IN'))).toUpperCase()}

// SESUDAH (lebih robust):
{(tx.table?.tableName || tx.cafeTable?.tableName 
  || (tx.tableId ? `MEJA ${tx.tableId}` : (tx.cafeTableId ? `MEJA CAFE-${tx.cafeTableId}` : 'WALK-IN'))).toUpperCase()}
```

